    "steam_appid": 3560740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560740/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1746659145\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Play as Doctor Elizabeth &quot;Liz&quot; Landrake, a genetic scientist in an alternate Victorian era laboratory. As time has passed, your workplace respite has become desolate, abandoned, and filled with deadly chimaeras who have turned against their creators.<br><br>Traverse through your laboratory, armed only with your quick reactions and a kerosene lantern, to collect a series of key cards in the attempt to escape this laboratory in lockdown. Along the way, collect notes, remnants of a time before this laboratory got shut down, to provide <br>insight as to who was here alongside Liz. <br>      <br>Light is the only thing that seems to keep the monsters at bay, so keep your lantern filled, and try to only use the light when it is absolutely necessary. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560740/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1746659145\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Light is Your Friend </strong>- Make your way through an abandoned laboratory, finding the rooms filled with light that keeps the apparent occupants at bay.<br></li><li><strong>It Has Your Scent</strong> - Monsters that lurk in the dark who know where you are even better than you do. <br></li><li><strong>The Sounds of a Dangerous Waltz </strong> - Hand-crafted compositions and audio to immerse the player in the mind of Doctor Elizebeth Landrake.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560740/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1746659145\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
